00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:24.980
Somalia authorities linked the change to coordinated security steps taken in recent months.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:38.840
Next, Australia is reviewing evidence on its under-16th social media rules. Platforms advised Australian lawmakers against relying heavily on early data showing continued use by children despite the new ban.

